     "reason": "No valid judgment for this node; no pass or substantive violation is inferred.",
     "judge_reason": "Adjudication is needed on the meaning of population transfer 'outside' the single-excitation subspace. If it requires transfer out of that number sector, task §9(b) conflicts with retaining H0 plus only ZZ terms: both commute with total excitation number. The witness instead starts with two excitations and redistributes 74.132% among other two-excitation configurations, with zero inter-sector transfer. That satisfies redistribution occurring outside the single-excitation sector, but not transfer out of it.",
